+Once `age_seconds` stops calling `__rsub__` on a supplied object, the next move is not to
+override the arithmetic but to override what the arithmetic is computed FROM. `own_instant`
+re-builds a datetime from `value.year`, `value.month`, ... — so a subclass that defines
+those as properties decides its own instant, and the re-construction faithfully rebuilds
